From 3f8439899becb40ac41c7cfbd13362f6b601731c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:44:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Ship the Plex fonts with the app instead of as npm packages

Vite could not resolve @fontsource/* on a checkout that had not run
npm install, so the window never loaded. The five latin woff2 files now
live in desktop/src/fonts (OFL licence alongside); package.json is back
to its previous dependency set, so no install step is needed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K5M7FnXPWrv7D7XYUXLqa1
